  "summary": {
    "plain": "With 100 days of data XENON100 saw three candidate events, consistent with the expected background, and no dark matter.",
    "technical": "100.9 live days (January-June 2010), 48 kg fiducial target; three candidate events in a pre-defined signal region with an expected background of 1.8 +/- 0.6 events; spin-independent limit 7.0e-45 cm^2 at 50 GeV/c^2 (90% CL)."
